<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Regulator approves St George takeover.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Regulator approves St George takeover.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Competition and Consumer Commission (ACCC) said on Friday it would not oppose the takeover of Advance Bank Australia Ltd by fellow Sydney-based regional bank St George Bank Ltd.</p>
</text>
